{
  "id": "MURDER-08",
  "title": "Who Put Bella in the Wych Elm? Nobody Ever Answered",
  "category": "murder",
  "voice": "am_adam",
  "speed": 1.05,
  "mood": "murder",
  "target_seconds": 67,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L01",
      "text": "Who put Bella down the Wych Elm?",
      "pause_after": 0.35,
      "shot": "S01",
      "emphasis": [
        "Bella",
        "Wych",
        "Elm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L02",
      "text": "In 1944, someone wrote that on a wall in Birmingham.",
      "pause_after": 0.25,
      "shot": "S02",
      "emphasis": [
        "1944",
        "wall"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L03",
      "text": "It was about a real woman. Nobody knows who she was.",
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot": "S03",
      "emphasis": [
        "real",
        "Nobody"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L04",
      "text": "April 1943. Four boys were out in Hagley Wood, in Worcestershire.",
      "pause_after": 0.2,
      "shot": "S04",
      "emphasis": [
        "1943",
        "Hagley"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L05",
      "text": "One climbed an old wych elm and looked down into its hollow trunk.",
      "pause_after": 0.2,
      "shot": "S05",
      "emphasis": [
        "hollow"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L06",
      "text": "In the dark, he saw a skull.",
      "pause_after": 0.6,
      "shot": "S06",
      "emphasis": [
        "skull"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L07",
      "text": "Inside the tree, police found the skeleton of a woman.",
      "pause_after": 0.25,
      "shot": "S07",
      "emphasis": [
        "skeleton",
        "woman"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L08",
      "text": "Investigators estimated she'd been dead about a year and a half.",
      "pause_after": 0.25,
      "shot": "S08",
      "emphasis": [
        "year",
        "half"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L09",
      "text": "She was probably about 35, and five feet tall.",
      "pause_after": 0.25,
      "shot": "S09",
      "emphasis": [
        "35",
        "five"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L10",
      "text": "There was a shoe, a wedding ring, and scraps of clothing.",
      "pause_after": 0.3,
      "shot": "S10",
      "emphasis": [
        "shoe",
        "ring"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L11",
      "text": "But no one could put a name to her.",
      "pause_after": 0.45,
      "shot": "S11",
      "emphasis": [
        "name"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L12",
      "text": "Then, in 1944, the messages began, calling her Bella.",
      "pause_after": 0.3,
      "shot": "S12",
      "emphasis": [
        "Bella"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L13",
      "text": "The writer of the messages was never found.",
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "shot": "S13",
      "emphasis": [
        "never"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L14",
      "text": "In 1945, an anthropologist suggested witchcraft.",
      "pause_after": 0.15,
      "shot": "S14",
      "emphasis": [
        "witchcraft"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L15",
      "text": "Investigators dismissed the idea.",
      "pause_after": 0.35,
      "shot": "S15",
      "emphasis": [
        "dismissed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L16",
      "text": "A 1953 letter to a local paper tied her to a wartime spy ring.",
      "pause_after": 0.2,
      "shot": "S16",
      "emphasis": [
        "spy",
        "ring"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L17",
      "text": "That claim was never proven either.",
      "pause_after": 0.45,
      "shot": "S17",
      "emphasis": [
        "never",
        "proven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L18",
      "text": "And today, even her skeleton is missing.",
      "pause_after": 0.25,
      "shot": "S18",
      "emphasis": [
        "missing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L19",
      "text": "So are key case records.",
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "shot": "S18",
      "emphasis": [
        "records"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L20",
      "text": "For decades, the question has kept reappearing on an obelisk near the wood.",
      "pause_after": 0.3,
      "shot": "S19",
      "emphasis": [
        "obelisk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L21",
      "text": "More than 80 years on, all that's left is the question.",
      "pause_after": 0.3,
      "shot": "S20",
      "emphasis": [
        "question"
      ]
    }
  ],
